WEBVTT

00:02.190 --> 00:03.480
Here he comes!

00:03.970 --> 00:05.230
The one we've been waiting for!

00:05.550 --> 00:07.980
The crowd's mood has changed.

00:07.980 --> 00:08.680
Why, though?

00:08.680 --> 00:12.460
To think we'd be able to
see this man fight again!

00:12.460 --> 00:15.740
The crowd is quivering in bliss!

00:15.740 --> 00:18.460
Suiryu is here!

00:18.460 --> 00:21.230
He'll be going up against Max!

00:21.640 --> 00:26.380
He's got quite the reputation,
but is he actually better than me?

00:27.700 --> 00:31.840
No... Remember, Lightning Max.

00:32.570 --> 00:34.720
The opponent I really need to surpass...

00:36.260 --> 00:40.600
Compared to that monster, you're puny.

00:41.050 --> 00:45.230
Suiryu, I have to get stronger.

00:45.230 --> 00:47.900
Otherwise, I won't be able to
protect everyone as a hero.

00:47.900 --> 00:49.610
Unfortunately for you,

00:49.610 --> 00:55.950
I view you as a worthy opponent for
testing a new anti-monster technique!

00:56.320 --> 00:58.980
So you're a pro hero?

00:59.490 --> 01:03.710
With rather lofty ambitions, I see.

01:03.710 --> 01:07.460
I guess everyone has their own
reasons for seeking strength.

01:09.800 --> 01:11.240
Take your stance.

01:11.840 --> 01:12.720
Begin!

01:13.060 --> 01:17.720
Lightning Big Wheel Double Ax Kick!

01:21.560 --> 01:24.520
The reason I sought strength...

01:35.780 --> 01:39.270
was so I could glide through life easily.

01:39.270 --> 01:41.620
Sorry I'm the stronger one.

03:13.520 --> 03:15.390
D-Did you see that, Charanko?!

03:15.390 --> 03:17.200
Did you see Suiryu's kick?!

03:17.200 --> 03:18.470
Yeah, why?

03:19.620 --> 03:21.510
How are you so calm right now?

03:22.760 --> 03:25.430
Oh, it must be because he's an amateur.

03:25.430 --> 03:28.150
He took down a Class A
hero in a single blow.

03:28.150 --> 03:31.140
I guess there's a surprising
number of civilians

03:31.140 --> 03:32.650
who are stronger than pro heroes.

03:32.650 --> 03:34.440
I guess that's to be expected.

03:34.440 --> 03:37.610
Master Saitama was also
doing hero work as a hobby.

03:37.610 --> 03:40.760
It makes sense that there could be
other powerful people like him.

03:40.760 --> 03:44.050
I'm sure none of them are
on Master's level, though.

03:44.050 --> 03:49.290
But that man might be able to satisfy
Master's desire to experience martial arts.

03:52.760 --> 03:53.500
This is...

03:53.500 --> 03:56.860
Ladies and gentlemen, I'm sure
you're even more fired up now,

03:56.860 --> 03:57.810
but next up,

03:57.810 --> 04:01.930
we have Benpats from Bad Roads Martial
Arts and Snek from Snakebite Fist!

04:01.930 --> 04:05.920
Whoever wins this fight will face off
against Suiryu in the second round!

04:05.920 --> 04:07.570
You're a Class A hero?

04:08.270 --> 04:10.150
You don't look very strong.

04:10.150 --> 04:13.320
If I can defeat Suiryu,
who defeated Lightning Max,

04:13.320 --> 04:16.820
it might have a positive effect on my rank.

04:16.820 --> 04:17.820
All right.

04:18.530 --> 04:20.050
Snakebite Fist.

04:20.780 --> 04:23.990
Like anyone would fall for a fake
stance like that nowadays.

04:23.990 --> 04:27.120
You lowest-ranking hero jerk!

04:27.120 --> 04:28.500
I'm not the lowest ranking.

04:28.750 --> 04:30.670
I'm the lowest-ranking Class A hero!

04:31.620 --> 04:32.380
There's trouble!

04:32.380 --> 04:34.960
An extremely violent monster
has appeared nearby!

04:35.590 --> 04:37.590
We need to evacuate everyone immediately!

04:37.590 --> 04:39.910
Seriously? Hurry up and
make the announcement—

04:39.910 --> 04:41.260
There's no need.

04:41.260 --> 04:43.230
Huh? Bakuzan!

04:43.230 --> 04:45.400
That'll just cause people to panic.

04:45.400 --> 04:48.390
But if a monster shows up at this venue...

04:48.870 --> 04:51.350
Look at how many martial
arts masters we have here.

04:51.750 --> 04:53.900
No place could be safer.

04:53.900 --> 04:55.390
True...

04:55.390 --> 04:59.720
Don't worry. If any monsters
infiltrate the venue,

04:59.720 --> 05:01.610
I'll take care of them myself.

05:01.610 --> 05:03.600
Monsters have appeared, huh?

05:03.600 --> 05:05.620
That's way too many.

05:05.620 --> 05:09.290
City C... There's one in this city, too.

05:09.290 --> 05:11.210
Should I let Master know?

05:12.730 --> 05:15.000
No, I can just go take care of it myself.

05:15.760 --> 05:17.740
I won't let it interfere
with this tournament.

05:17.740 --> 05:21.090
No matter how many small fry there are,
I'll dispose of them immediately.

05:24.250 --> 05:25.600
Wh-What the hell?

05:26.070 --> 05:28.490
You aren't weak at all...

05:29.420 --> 05:30.680
The winner is Snek!

05:32.100 --> 05:35.570
I want to believe that I rank
among the strongest myself.

05:35.570 --> 05:38.020
But you get sick of the reality pretty quick.

05:38.470 --> 05:42.670
The battlefield of top heroes is
filled with nothing but monsters.

05:43.740 --> 05:44.890
Incinerate.

05:49.850 --> 05:51.200
It's the Demon Cyborg!

05:51.200 --> 05:53.060
That was some blow!

05:53.060 --> 05:54.210
We're saved!

05:54.640 --> 05:58.560
I'm currently in City C near the stadium.
What's the situation?

05:58.970 --> 06:02.550
Multiple monsters have appeared
simultaneously in several cities.

06:02.930 --> 06:05.010
We've confirmed that there are
currently five in City C.

06:05.430 --> 06:08.940
Mr. Demon Cyborg,
there's another monster over there.

06:08.940 --> 06:10.640
There's one over there, too!

06:11.220 --> 06:13.090
I got rid of one.

06:13.090 --> 06:14.860
Where are the other four?

06:14.860 --> 06:16.900
I'll guide you to them.

06:18.840 --> 06:21.150
A blow charged with electricity!

06:21.150 --> 06:23.650
The winner is Boltane!

06:24.030 --> 06:27.660
Gatling's super fast punches have
finally taken down Hamukichi.

06:27.660 --> 06:30.700
He can no longer stand!

06:31.070 --> 06:34.830
Dave immediately opened the match
with an explosive body press!

06:34.830 --> 06:36.790
Rosie was taken down in mere seconds!

06:37.460 --> 06:39.710
And the referee had to interfere!

06:39.710 --> 06:41.420
Choze is strong!

06:41.420 --> 06:43.630
Mentai didn't stand a chance!

06:44.180 --> 06:46.050
Rocket Stomp!

06:51.690 --> 06:53.520
I know there's another
one of you in the area.

06:53.520 --> 06:58.100
Tell me where they are or continue
to suffer until you die.

06:58.100 --> 06:59.360
Choose one.

06:59.780 --> 07:03.440
Next up, we have Jakumen
from Giga Pro Wrestling

07:03.440 --> 07:05.850
versus Sourface from Sourface-Style Kenpo!

07:05.850 --> 07:08.480
They are both competing
here for the first time!

07:08.480 --> 07:09.930
Do your best out there, Sourface!

07:09.930 --> 07:13.940
Shut up! I used to be
Master Bang's second-best student!

07:16.520 --> 07:18.130
This guy's pretty huge.

07:18.130 --> 07:20.580
No, wait. I'm stronger!

07:20.580 --> 07:21.530
I think...

07:21.530 --> 07:24.040
Think back on all of your rigorous training!

07:24.520 --> 07:27.880
This guy's face is pretty scary...

07:29.300 --> 07:32.100
Lemme have your face.

07:36.060 --> 07:39.350
There you are. I'm going to eliminate you.

07:39.350 --> 07:42.590
Oh, hey. If it isn't a celebrity.

07:42.590 --> 07:45.650
Can I rip off your face, too?

08:01.530 --> 08:04.600
How do you like my knifework?

08:06.290 --> 08:08.680
I had you hit my hard head on purpose.

08:09.700 --> 08:11.180
High Voltage Fist!

08:13.260 --> 08:14.720
Begone.

08:16.770 --> 08:18.730
He's taking care of them in seconds.

08:19.230 --> 08:22.900
The Class S hero, Genos...
He's incredibly powerful.

08:23.360 --> 08:28.070
Demon Cyborg... The last one is two
kilometers northwest from there.

08:28.510 --> 08:30.530
There are already others
engaged in battle there.

08:34.620 --> 08:36.040
Can you speak?

08:36.370 --> 08:40.790
Wh-When you're fighting him,
make sure you don't lose sight of him.

08:41.130 --> 08:42.920
He'll be behind you before you know it.

08:42.920 --> 08:45.110
Are you a Class S hero?

08:45.110 --> 08:47.420
Do you hate cockroaches, too?

08:48.650 --> 08:52.840
Not cockroaches in particular, but I have
a long-running feud with bug monsters.

08:52.840 --> 08:54.600
The last one.

08:55.240 --> 08:57.330
If I can take care of
this one with no issues,

08:57.330 --> 08:59.680
I might make it to Master's match in time.

08:59.680 --> 09:02.400
Just so you know, I'm strong.

09:03.090 --> 09:06.170
Jakumen ends up tapping out!

09:06.170 --> 09:08.690
That was an excellent finishing
move on Sourface's part!

09:08.690 --> 09:11.070
And they're holding each other up!

09:11.070 --> 09:13.780
What beautiful sportsmanship!

09:14.280 --> 09:16.120
Did you win, Sourface?

09:16.120 --> 09:19.180
What?! Weren't you watching, Charanko?

09:19.180 --> 09:21.160
Didn't you see how awesome I was?

09:21.160 --> 09:22.580
I was in the bathroom.

09:22.580 --> 09:24.140
You jerk...

09:24.140 --> 09:27.250
Hey! The guy you're up against next...

09:27.560 --> 09:29.170
Be careful with him.

09:29.170 --> 09:31.760
I've seen Bakuzan in action before.

09:30.800 --> 09:34.260
Crap... I undid my obi in the bathroom,

09:31.760 --> 09:34.260
He shows no mercy to inferior opponents...

09:34.260 --> 09:36.140
Hey!

09:34.260 --> 09:36.140
and I don't know how to retie it.

09:36.140 --> 09:37.930
Are you listening?!

09:37.930 --> 09:43.130
Next up, we have Charanko,
fresh off a victory over Zakkos,

09:43.130 --> 09:46.940
versus Bakuzan, a former
two-time consecutive winner!

09:46.940 --> 09:52.360
He is the master of Darkness Hellkill,
which has left many fighters bloody!

09:52.360 --> 09:58.410
Will he be sending even more of his
opponents to the hospital this time around?

09:59.680 --> 10:02.790
I'm just teaching those
who lack resolve a lesson.

10:03.280 --> 10:08.450
Listen up. When two martial
artists fight, it's not a sport.

10:08.450 --> 10:10.580
Lives are at stake...

10:11.070 --> 10:12.190
Hey!

10:12.190 --> 10:13.870
Well, whatever. This should work.

10:14.730 --> 10:15.640
I'm going to kill you.

10:16.680 --> 10:17.220
Begin!

10:17.220 --> 10:23.140
And it's begun! How does Charanko
plan to fight against Bakuzan?

10:24.400 --> 10:27.520
He's wide open. What's with this guy?

10:28.160 --> 10:30.190
Does he even have the will to fight?

10:30.750 --> 10:34.740
Uh-oh! Bakuzan is closing
the gap between them!

10:34.740 --> 10:35.730
Hey, you.

10:36.330 --> 10:37.930
Are you an amateur?

10:37.930 --> 10:41.620
Yeah. This is actually my first
time doing one of these things.

10:41.620 --> 10:43.870
Let me experience your
martial arts technique.

10:44.690 --> 10:46.030
Very well.

10:46.480 --> 10:49.130
As you wish, I'll give you my full
course before executing you.

10:49.590 --> 10:51.210
First, your leg.

10:51.780 --> 10:56.970
My Demon-Sweeper Low Kick crushes bone,
so you'll never be able to stand again.

10:57.880 --> 10:58.970
Next, your torso.

10:59.520 --> 11:04.180
After my Bear-Killer Mid
Kick and Carnage Punch...

11:04.810 --> 11:08.310
your arm will break,
and your guts will go flying.

11:08.310 --> 11:10.650
Lastly, your head...

11:10.650 --> 11:13.900
My Hell-Bringin' Hand Chop
will split your skull,

11:13.900 --> 11:15.550
so you can kiss this world goodb—

11:15.550 --> 11:17.200
Don't touch my head!

11:21.780 --> 11:24.310
Uh... Out of bounds...

11:24.310 --> 11:27.480
Crap. I missed out on the
actual fighting part again.

11:27.480 --> 11:30.540
The match is over! Someone get a stretcher!

11:31.160 --> 11:34.340
What an absolutely stunning upset!

11:34.340 --> 11:37.160
The one who defeated Bakuzan,
who was favored to win this tournament,

11:37.160 --> 11:40.360
was Charanko, who is competing
here for the first time!

11:40.360 --> 11:42.680
He finished him in one punch again.

11:42.680 --> 11:45.940
Okay, then. I guess I'll do that, too.

11:47.640 --> 11:53.110
Mr. Ignoramus is here to explain
the recent monster outbreak.

11:53.680 --> 11:58.990
Mr. Ignoramus, what are your thoughts
on the recent outbreak of monsters?

12:00.960 --> 12:02.490
Nothing?

12:03.700 --> 12:06.450
Oh, we've just received new information.

12:07.340 --> 12:12.670
The Class A hero Lightning Genji was
critically injured and has collapsed.

12:13.040 --> 12:15.340
What do you think about this?

12:16.520 --> 12:18.780
I see that you're speechless.

12:18.780 --> 12:19.430
Hey!

12:19.790 --> 12:21.300
Hey, wake up!

12:22.740 --> 12:23.640
Ow...

12:23.640 --> 12:25.180
Are you all right, Mohican?

12:25.180 --> 12:27.640
There should have been a
father and a son here.

12:28.070 --> 12:29.920
Do you know where the son went?

12:32.160 --> 12:36.110
Mr. Narinki's son, Wanganma,
was kidnapped by monsters.

12:36.430 --> 12:38.920
What?! But why?

12:38.920 --> 12:44.740
We're not sure, but Mr. Narinki's
contributions cover 7% of our expenses,

12:44.740 --> 12:47.670
so we cannot lose his trust.

12:47.670 --> 12:52.030
Right. Getting Waganma back
safely takes top priority.

12:52.030 --> 12:55.630
Gather all heroes at Class A and up!

12:55.630 --> 12:56.650
But...

12:56.650 --> 13:00.010
Are you saying to ignore all the
monsters rampaging through the cities?

13:00.010 --> 13:04.850
The Class S hero Metal Bat has been found
critically injured and unconscious.

13:06.260 --> 13:07.970
Come on, now. What's wrong?

13:10.770 --> 13:12.980
You can't hit me like that.

13:13.740 --> 13:15.230
I can't get a good shot at him...

13:16.490 --> 13:18.460
Where are you looking?
I'm right over here!

13:23.370 --> 13:24.870
It's not just that he's fast...

13:25.230 --> 13:30.450
My eyes can't keep up with his unusual
movements, and he slips between buildings.

13:30.450 --> 13:31.780
You leave me no choice.

13:32.330 --> 13:34.330
I didn't want to use this, but...

13:34.330 --> 13:39.190
Oh? Do you still have something
else up your sleeve?

13:39.190 --> 13:42.430
Are you going to shoot laser
beams from your eyes?

13:42.980 --> 13:47.560
I didn't even want to equip myself
with this, but Dr. Kuseno was right.

13:47.560 --> 13:50.310
Tracking missiles? Poisonous gas?

13:50.310 --> 13:56.400
I will not grow if I cannot
face superior opponents.

13:56.400 --> 13:59.940
It's not pesticide, is it?

14:00.930 --> 14:02.280
Wh-What the...

14:03.250 --> 14:05.530
My legs! This is...

14:05.530 --> 14:08.160
It's an instantaneous
super-strength adhesive.

14:08.160 --> 14:13.660
Even if a super-fast ninja attacks me,
I can take them out in an instant.

14:14.250 --> 14:18.500
But by using this, I'm basically
acknowledging how fast he is.

14:18.810 --> 14:20.000
What are you talking about?!

14:20.850 --> 14:23.200
I guess this doesn't concern you.

14:23.760 --> 14:25.470
Incinerate.

14:34.490 --> 14:36.370
Did he leave his feet behind and flee?

14:36.930 --> 14:38.960
Either way, he's critically injured.

14:39.460 --> 14:41.680
I guess I can head back to the stadium.

14:41.680 --> 14:44.070
I might make it back in
time for Master's match.

14:44.980 --> 14:46.690
Something's approaching at high speed...

14:47.120 --> 14:50.870
Is it the cockroach? No...
This is something different.

14:57.680 --> 15:02.920
Hey... You're not supposed to fall
under her control so easily!

15:02.920 --> 15:05.480
You're so cute when you're panicked.

15:05.480 --> 15:09.850
Too bad for you,
but they're all my slaves now.

15:12.260 --> 15:14.600
How does it feel to have your
subordinates taken from you?

15:14.600 --> 15:17.560
Come on, you'd better fight back.

15:17.560 --> 15:19.480
You must be holding back.

15:20.800 --> 15:25.320
In that case, I'll let you join
them as one of my slaves!

15:31.160 --> 15:33.490
You're not gonna survive like that.

15:33.490 --> 15:34.910
Shut up!

15:36.290 --> 15:39.690
Wow, you hold up against
these numbers quite well.

15:40.590 --> 15:43.380
But I wonder how long you can keep that up!

15:47.520 --> 15:50.890
Here we go! I'm going to lash you to pieces!

15:55.980 --> 15:57.770
She's feeling that.

15:57.770 --> 16:00.190
Now you're mine.

16:00.560 --> 16:04.030
By the way, you're one of the
Psychic Sisters, aren't you?

16:04.850 --> 16:09.410
In other words, your little sister is
the Class S hero Terrible Tornado.

16:09.840 --> 16:15.200
Meaning if I use you as bait,
I can lure Tornado out.

16:15.660 --> 16:18.580
Good thing your little sister's so special.

16:27.100 --> 16:29.380
She hasn't lost her senses to my whip?

16:29.770 --> 16:33.490
Her will is so strong... I think I hate her.

16:37.600 --> 16:40.140
That hurt, you stupid bitch!

16:40.900 --> 16:44.640
I was going to use you to lure out
your little sister, but forget that!

16:44.640 --> 16:46.640
I'll rip you to shreds right now!

16:47.530 --> 16:50.820
You don't have to lure her out.
My older sister will come.

16:52.680 --> 16:53.950
What's this shaking?

16:54.330 --> 16:56.440
I guess she was closer than I thought.

16:57.240 --> 17:00.080
She can sense when I've sustained damage.

17:01.100 --> 17:01.540
She's coming.

17:02.810 --> 17:04.250
Explosions?!

17:04.730 --> 17:06.250
Something's coming nearer.

17:06.970 --> 17:08.550
Something terrible!

17:12.460 --> 17:14.180
She's coming.

17:14.570 --> 17:16.540
Terrible Tornado.

17:18.470 --> 17:20.810
S-Super S...

17:21.460 --> 17:24.560
There's an insane monster
on the hero side, too...

17:25.160 --> 17:27.960
She's even worse than I thought.

17:25.160 --> 17:29.130
She destroyed... us all...

17:28.420 --> 17:30.360
I should probably get out of here...

17:30.790 --> 17:31.820
There she is.

17:34.080 --> 17:37.870
Big Sis! I-I haven't lost ye—

17:37.870 --> 17:41.010
Go on home already, Blizzard.

17:41.010 --> 17:43.750
I'll clean up your mess.

17:43.750 --> 17:47.840
S-Slaves! Buy me time to run away!

17:49.480 --> 17:53.490
Wait! They're on our side!
Please don't attack them!

17:58.210 --> 18:00.640
I just asked you to not attack them...

18:01.290 --> 18:03.600
I wouldn't call this an attack.

18:03.600 --> 18:05.040
Uh, that was definitely an attack.

18:05.040 --> 18:09.500
Also, I wouldn't say they're on our side.
They're just a hindrance.

18:09.500 --> 18:12.860
I'm surprised you still had that
Class B club thing going on.

18:13.380 --> 18:15.990
Ugh, she escaped.

18:16.440 --> 18:18.850
I probably shouldn't waste time here talking

18:18.850 --> 18:21.660
since there are apparently other monsters.

18:22.170 --> 18:24.340
Could you tell your flunkies

18:24.340 --> 18:28.480
that they're just in the way,
so they should probably just run?

18:35.530 --> 18:39.640
I'd be denying my own worth,
so I was trying not to think about it...

18:40.040 --> 18:43.730
But this isn't good.
I'm thinking about it again.

18:45.440 --> 18:48.480
I want to eat you!
I want to eat human flesh!

18:48.480 --> 18:50.210
Hold it right there!

18:50.210 --> 18:55.200
Now that I, Snakebite Snek, am here,
I won't let you hurt anyone else!

18:56.000 --> 18:59.160
I was shining so brightly back then.

18:59.160 --> 19:02.950
I was someone special who had
the power to protect the masses.

19:02.950 --> 19:07.370
The fact that I was a real
hero fulfilled my spirit.

19:08.080 --> 19:10.880
But over time, I began to
see reality a bit clearer.

19:11.290 --> 19:15.120
There were creatures out there I couldn't
defeat, no matter how much I struggled.

19:15.120 --> 19:20.510
There were even nameless civilians
out there that I couldn't defeat.

19:21.100 --> 19:24.160
Are pro heroes actually necessary?

19:24.390 --> 19:26.500
I find myself asking that a lot lately.

19:27.170 --> 19:29.020
Maybe even if I didn't exist...

19:29.530 --> 19:31.570
Even if the Hero Association didn't exist...

19:31.940 --> 19:36.030
There'd still be someone else
to defeat the monsters.

19:36.560 --> 19:41.620
If anything, this man definitely doesn't
seem like he'd need me to protect him.

19:42.140 --> 19:45.000
That Max guy earlier had a little more oomph.

19:45.000 --> 19:48.750
Why do you just keep dodging?
Why not attack?

19:49.190 --> 19:52.380
I wanted to at least confirm your abilities.

19:53.170 --> 19:55.880
Class A heroes get a pretty
high salary, don't they?

19:55.880 --> 19:59.340
If someone at your level can
do it, it might be a decent job.

20:00.140 --> 20:02.720
Just kidding. I'd just want the money.

20:04.050 --> 20:05.970
Why are you so strong?

20:06.420 --> 20:10.560
You're frivolous and lack all ambition.

20:12.010 --> 20:13.940
Maybe it's just pure talent.

20:13.940 --> 20:16.260
You really piss me off.

20:16.260 --> 20:20.360
When I was training, I'd just
randomly spar with my master.

20:20.360 --> 20:22.830
But I haven't even trained
the last couple of years.

20:23.200 --> 20:28.040
Why do you bother being a hero?
I mean, at your skill level...

20:28.040 --> 20:29.790
Wh-What?!

20:29.790 --> 20:32.700
There are many more
powerful monsters lately.

20:32.700 --> 20:35.920
Is there even a reason
for you to try anymore?

20:36.660 --> 20:40.730
Even if there weren't any heroes, the people
who could survive would still survive.

20:40.730 --> 20:44.560
The weak are weeded out,
whether we have monsters or not.

20:44.560 --> 20:46.770
That's how nature works.

20:46.770 --> 20:51.440
So you're saying that we should just
let the monsters kill people?!

20:51.440 --> 20:52.100
What's going on?!

20:52.510 --> 20:53.680
Is this part of the show?

20:54.520 --> 20:55.560
Monsters!

20:55.560 --> 20:56.530
Inside the hospital?!

20:56.530 --> 21:00.130
We'll hold them back!
Everyone, get to the roof!

21:00.620 --> 21:03.720
Despite that, we survive.

21:03.720 --> 21:06.200
What the hell does a monster want at a jail?

21:06.200 --> 21:09.200
The boss escaped from jail
to defeat some monsters!

21:09.200 --> 21:11.760
So Puri-Puri Prisoner isn't here?

21:12.260 --> 21:13.420
Oh, well.

21:13.760 --> 21:15.420
Who are you saying will survive?

21:19.340 --> 21:20.880
The strong.

21:21.470 --> 21:22.220
What—

21:24.010 --> 21:25.970
This is what I'm talking about.

21:29.960 --> 21:31.600
Sounds exciting out there.

23:02.720 --> 23:07.570
Well, Gyoro-Gyoro, are the monsters
we sent forth wreaking havoc?

23:07.570 --> 23:13.460
Yes. We've lost some, but it appears
that we still remain dominant.

23:13.460 --> 23:16.250
The Hero Association is panicking.

23:16.250 --> 23:18.580
What is Goketsu doing?

23:18.580 --> 23:21.160
It seems he's heading toward
an event venue where

23:21.160 --> 23:23.170
there's a martial arts tournament going on.

23:23.170 --> 23:31.850
So far, our big victories include Demon
Cyborg, Metal Bat, and Metal Knight.

23:31.850 --> 23:36.350
And we still have our
main forces on standby.

23:36.350 --> 23:39.940
Victory is certain for the
Monster Association,

23:39.940 --> 23:43.220
Monster King Orochi.
